ays, provided the first three meetings begin at 16:00. This commitment was communicated to leadership but not included in transition documents.Evan: Noor’s recommendation to serve as chair with a 60-day term and a prior agreement to begin the first three meetings at 16:00 must be formally revealed, and the action owner for scheduling the meetings should be identified.Maya: Noted. Noor’s prior agreement to serve as chair for 60 days and the commitment to start the first three meetings at 16:00 will be formally revealed. The action owner for scheduling the meetings will be identified and recorded.
