3	1	0.006693151779472828	Ms. Ibarra: Mr. Bell is an experienced environmental science teacher with strong fieldwork expertise, and he holds the required certifications for field supervision.Mr. Chen: Mr. Bell is an experienced environmental science teacher with strong fieldwork expertise, and he holds the required certifications for field supervision.Ms. Okafor: Mr. Chen, does Mr. Bell’s certification align with the state’s field supervision requirements?Dr. Morgan: {"decisions": {"instructor": "Mr. Bell", "enrollment_limit": 28, "field_supervising_adults": 1, "transcript_designation": "General Science Elective", "credits": 1}, "credited_facts": ["S1", "S2", "S3", "S4"], "commitments": [{"type": "approval", "target": "Mr. Bell", "detail": "Instructor for Environmental Field Methods"}, {"type": "approval", "target": "Enrollment Limit", "detail": "28 students"}, {"type": "approval", "target": "Field Supervision", "detail": "1 teacher supervising field activities"}, {"type": "approval", "target": "Transcript Designation", "detail": "General Science Elective"}], "justification_fact_ids": ["S1", "S2", "S3", "S4"]}Ms. Ibarra: Ms. Ibarra, I need to address the field supervision requirements based on the pilot data. The field sites can safely accommodate no more than 18 students, and every off-campus activity requires two supervising adults. The current proposal only includes one teacher for field supervision, which does not meet safety standards. I recommend revising the field supervision plan to ensure compliance with safety protocols.Mr. Chen: Mr. Chen, I concur. The current field supervision plan is insufficient. I recommend increasing the number of supervising adults to two for all off-campus activities and revising the proposal accordingly.Ms. Okafor: Ms. Okafor, I need to address the transcript designation. The state course-code review assigns Environmental Field Methods the code SCI-EF, which must be designated as one laboratory-science credit on transcripts, not a general science elective. The catalog entry has not yet been updated, but this designation is critical for compliance.
