e is 1 hour and 30 minutes. The movement board must be updated with the vent cap removal, forklift use, and axle-balance check.SFC Brooks: I confirm the load plan as presented. The movement board will be updated with the vent cap inspection, forklift use for the generator, and axle-balance check for the communications shelter. All required checks are in place, and the trailer is ready for dispatch after the 1 hour and 30 minutes loading window.
